---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Methodology — How We Produce Neutral, Source-Backed Analysis" description="Our editorial methodology: neutrality, sourcing standards, and verification.">
  <main class="page">
    <header class="page-header">
      <h1>Methodology</h1>
      <p class="page-sub">How we produce neutral, source-backed policy and trade analysis.</p>
    </header>

    <section class="section">
      <h2>1. Neutrality</h2>
      <p>We analyze policy and trade developments without political bias. We do not evaluate foreign leaders subjectively, and we do not produce inflammatory or nationally divisive content.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <h2>2. Sourcing standards</h2>
      <p>We rely only on primary and official sources: government publications, central banks, trade ministries, and official regional bodies (e.g., ASEAN). We cross-verify each event from at least two independent sources before writing. Conflicting sources cause the topic to be dropped, not forced.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <h2>3. Verification &amp; the five-part data discipline</h2>
      <p>Every figure carries: value + unit + time + named source + fetch date. Unverifiable figures are marked "pending verification" and such articles are not published.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <h2>4. Corrections</h2>
      <p>When underlying facts change materially, we publish a public correction in the article's revision history rather than silently editing dates.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <h2>5. Disclaimer</h2>
      <p>All content is policy and trade analysis for informational purposes only and does not constitute investment or legal advice.</p>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
.page {
  max-width: 720px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  padding: 48px 24px 80px;
}

.page-header {
  margin-bottom: 48px;
  padding-bottom: 24px;
  border-bottom: 2px solid #1a1a1a;
}

.page-header h1 {
  font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
  font-size: 2.75rem;
  font-weight: 800;
  line-height: 1.1;
  margin: 0 0 12px;
  color: #1a1a1a;
  letter-spacing: -0.02em;
}

.page-sub {
  font-size: 1.1rem;
  color: #666;
  margin: 0;
}

.section {
  margin-bottom: 40px;
}

.section h2 {
  font-family: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;
  font-size: 1.5rem;
  font-weight: 900;
  margin: 0 0 12px;
  color: #111;
}

.section p {
  font-size: 1.05rem;
  line-height: 1.7;
  color: #333;
  margin: 0;
}

@media (max-width: 640px) {
  .page { padding: 32px 16px 60px; }
  .page-header h1 { font-size: 2rem; }
  .section h2 { font-size: 1.2rem; }
  .section p { font-size: 1rem; }
}
</style>
